what's going on guys this is rob and we  are back with another episode of our  beyond omega level series and to be  honest i've been enjoying making these  avatar videos and taking a break from  the usual marvel and dc superheroes  which as much as i love them i'm sure  you guys probably agree kind of wears  thin after a little while so we're gonna  do another one now we've done videos on  avatar aang the series protagonist and  ira will do next week who of course is  definitely considered a fan favorite  character but today we're focusing on a  character that is not as well known but  still insanely powerful avatar kiyoshi  now kyoshi's first real appearance was  in the episode avatar day the fifth  episode of season two avatar the last  airbender but both of kyoshi's parents  were basically criminals her mom was an  air nomad nun that went on the run did  not mean for that to rhyme  and her father belonged to a very poor  family in the earth kingdom and while  kiyoshi was around five years old her  parents basically abandoned her leaving  her with a poor villager who immediately  put kiyoshi out on the street after  initially agreeing to take care of her  so that guy was obviously a dick but  kyoshi was then homeless until being  adopted by an air nomad monk named  kelsen and this guy had basically been  the air-bending instructor of avatar  kook who had immediately preceded kyoshi  as avatar now speaking of that the  revelation of kyoshi as the avatar  following the death of avatar kook is  pretty complicated so this guy belonged  to the northern water tribe meaning that  when he died the next avatar would come  to the earth kingdom and after looking  for quite a long time everybody in the  earth kingdom believed that a friend of  kyoshi's named yoon was the next avatar  and when it became apparent that it was  actually kiyoshi not yoon that was the  true avatar things got pretty messy the  reason for this mix-up was that yoon was  exceptionally good at earth bending so  much so that when kel sang and a master  earthbender named jian zhu basically  found this guy they assumed that he was  the avatar however as time went by and  yoon showed no ability to bend air fire  or water causing some to doubt whether  or not he was the genuine avatar zhan  zhu doubles down on his belief and  becomes yoon's primary trainer while  kyoshi is assigned to become his mate  now yoon fully devotes himself to  training to become the avatar and he and  kyoshi become really close friends and  then everything goes awry when kelsen  reveals that he thinks kiyoshi is the  true avatar after she uses her earth  binding to control the ocean floor and  destroy an entire fleet of ships now  jianzu takes both yoon and kiyoshi to a  cave to convene with a spirit named  father glowworm in hopes that the spirit  will reveal who is the true avatar now  once father glowworm reveals that kyoshi  is the true avatar jianzu leaves yoon to  be held prisoner by father glorym  literally fed him to a mountain but  shortly thereafter kyoshi would try to  escape the earth kingdom from kelsen but  jian zhu murders kelsing before they can  get away so following this kiyoshi and  her friend ranji both joined the flying  opera company which is the gang that her  parents belong to now ranji who came  from the fire nation serves as kyoshi's  fire-bending teacher and the two of them  also fall in love and so after being  attacked by jeon zhu and seeing him  killed by yoon who had long been  presumed dead kyoshi decides to reveal  herself to the world as the avatar now  as for her powers of course as the  avatar kyoshi was able to bend all four  elements earth air fire and water  meaning that she can manifest and  control each of these four elements  however kyoshi does have multiple  abilities that are not typical to all  vendors for instance during her time  with the flying opera company kiyoshi  learned a sub-skill of earthbending  called dust stepping which is literally  just what it sounds like creating clouds  of dust that she can walk on which  sounds pretty badass and which is  impressive because of one of kyoshi's  shortcomings for a long time which was  that she struggled with feats of earth  bending that required her to control  small particles of earth with precision  now what she never struggled with  however was moving around huge masses of  land which she's done some incredible  earth bending in that regard including  like i mentioned earlier bending the  ocean floor as well as throwing boulders  lifting entire buildings splitting walls  at will and digging moats  instantaneously now kiyoshi displayed a  natural adeptness at firebending and  developed her skills even further under  the tutelage of her girlfriend ranji not  only is she able to do all the typical  fire bending stuff but ranji developed a  technique based on dust stepping called  jet stepping which combines elements of  fire bending and earth bending holy sh  now kyoshi also had a natural talent for  airbending and was able to perform many  feats of airbending despite never really  receiving any training now in terms of  waterbending not only could kyoshi  manipulate huge quantities of water but  she could also use her abilities to heal  others using water bending and during  her final showdown with yoon following  his return as a villain she used them to  freeze his heart and lungs killing him  holy sh now during that same  confrontation she also used her powers  to heal ranji who had been mortally  wounded and did this by entering the  avatar state and using water from  underground reservoirs that's badass now  in what was probably kyoshi's most  impressive feat she accessed the avatar  state and used elements of earth bending  fire bending and air bending to create  kiyoshi island now in order to create  the island kiyoshi separated a peninsula  from the rest of a land mass by creating  a fissure deep enough to access the  mantle layer and then using lava bending  to separate the two masses of land  before using airbending to summon a wind  strong enough to move the land out into  the sea that's amazing now by the time  she died at the age of 230 wow making  her the longest living avatar on record  kiyoshi had cemented a legacy as one of  the greatest avatars of all time now  during her time as avatar she created an  elite force of warriors known as the  daily which were basically earth-bending  ninjas used by the earth king to put  down a peasant revolt although this  would muddy her legacy a bit because the  daily were eventually corrupted but even  so being able to train a group that  exercised such precision in their earth  bending like the daily is quite  impressive given that kiyoshi herself  struggled with precision for a long time  but kiyoshi also formed the kiyoshi  warriors an elite fighting force of  female warriors tasked with protecting  kyoshi island and that endured long  after her death and so kyoshi's time as  avatar was also a time of nearly  unprecedented peace that saw each nation  prosper and so shortly after her death  however that peace began to fall apart  and even in her homeland of the earth  kingdom as the earth king proved to be  corrupt using the daily to expel those  who basically opposed him and so what i  also want to do here i want to point out  probably one of the single most  significant abilities of kiyoshi beyond  all of this which is to be a narcissist  the girl named an island after herself  and then named an entire group of  warriors after herself how much of a  narcissist do you have to be to do that  with that being said guys we're gonna  bring this video to an end thank you all  for watching and i will catch you all  later peace
 

